# iservice_constraint_accepts_service.tkr — the §7 GAP-C anchor: the bare `IService` atom, not
# just `singleton`/`scoped`/`transient`, is a satisfiable constraint predicate. A concrete service
# auto-conforms to `IService` without listing it in `implements`; `constraint_atom_satisfied`'s
# `InterfaceBody` arm now recognizes that via `type_satisfies_iservice`.

Feature: iservice_constraint_accepts_service — a bare IService atom bound accepts a concrete service

